{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もぎりのお姉さん可愛かったなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は\n最後のセブン－イレブン限定ライブと\n最後の12thの全国握手会がありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セトリは\nカナ？1058参照"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/13/7192743/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のミニライブ前の影アナは\nひめたんと中田の二人でやらせてもらいました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぺろぺろ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手の方はですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/13/7192743/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛未と一緒のレーン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"94年組、乃木團、ホラー3部作\n一人っ子、A型"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか共通点はいろいろあるレーンだね(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとアンダーライブ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会がやってる時間に\n当落メールが来たみたいで\nみなさんからリアルタイムで結果を聞いたりもできて面白かったな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブから本当にたくさんの方が来てくださって\n嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/13/7192743/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん\n本当にありがとうございました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は個別ですね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の全握よりもゆっくり話せると思うので\nいろんな話がしたいなって思ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/13/7192743/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宿題です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/13/7192743/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お酒で失敗したことはある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/13/7192743/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達と遊ぶ時は何する？\n(映画観るとか、家でゲームするとか)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ループしすぎて話題ないとき\n初めましてで何話したらいいかわかんないとき\n答えを教えてください(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"持ち物チェック"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"□握手券\n□身分証明書\n(□トレード用の写真等)\n(□メンバーへのプレゼント)\n(□グッズ買うためのお金)\n□推しに対する愛"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は以前から755の方で約束した\nあの格好が見れちゃうかも( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/09/13/7192743/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}